# Dates settings
### START OF TEST PHASE
STARTOFSERVICE_YYYY='2023'
STARTOFSERVICE_MM='09'
STARTOFSERVICE_DD='01'
ENDOFSERVICE_YYYY='2024'
ENDOFSERVICE_MM='08'
ENDOFSERVICE_DD='31'
### END OF TEST PHASE
### START OF PRODUCTION PHASE
